# Lip sync in a real dialog (the dialog window plays the lines): the hero talks to Xardas, he and the
# hero speak in turn. The camera close to Xardas' face, then to the hero's.
cheat god
view clean 30
watch nearest
place 120 0
wait 300
dialog nearest
cam face 40 20 1
rec xardas
wait 12000
choose 1
wait 9000
stop
